# TURNIP TRUCK: MUSH MOB. Crowds of mushmen shuffle about the streets and
# towards the truck. Running one over is harmless but slows the truck a
# lot; a stopped truck with mushmen all round it loses hearts.
seed 7
game turnip
wait 5
cheat day 3 3
cheat notraffic
wait 240
expect mush > 15
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 276
cheat ang 0
cheat vel 2.5 0
cheat mob 1 430 276
wait 14
expect squashed == 1
expect speed100 < 160
expect hearts == 3
# swarmed
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 276
cheat stop
cheat mob 1 402 276
cheat mob 1 398 276
cheat mob 1 400 279
cheat mob 1 400 273
waituntil hit_by3 >= 1 120
expect hearts == 2
